# Sidecar ignore (buildx honors <dockerfile>.dockerignore) — keeps the repo-root
# build context light. Runners COPY only the paths they need; this denylists the
# heavy/irrelevant trees so `docker build .` doesn't tar 3.6 GB of server/target.
.git
.claude
server/target
**/target
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/vendor
**/.phpunit.cache
**/*.log
benchmark-queen
